# SwiftFormat config for RTI (Phase 0 lint gate).
#
# Minimal on purpose: pin the Swift version so local and CI agree, and otherwise
# use SwiftFormat's default rules. CI lints ONLY the Swift files a change touches
# (see .github/workflows/ci.yml), so the existing tree is never mass-reformatted —
# each file converges to this style the next time it's edited.
#
# Run locally before pushing:
#   swiftformat --lint <files-you-changed>     # check
#   swiftformat <files-you-changed>            # auto-fix

--swiftversion 6.0
